      "content": "it's hard to accept. people keep talking about \"the next chapter\" or \"finding new purpose,\" but they don't get it. when you've reached the peak, the only thing left is the descent. it feels almost disrespectful to the work i've done to just let it all wither away until it's unrecognizable. wouldn't it be more dignified to just... stop while the masterpiece is still intact?",
